{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3154800/extras/31aa212c66a8eae15999a41034d95c01.avif?t=1757247109\" data-has-big width=800 height=166 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&quot;MANAGE YOUR OWN FOOTBALL PITCH COMPLEX!&quot;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Football Pitch Simulator&quot;</strong> invites you on an exciting journey to manage your own football pitch empire! This game not only lets you manage your pitches but also requires you to make strategic decisions to keep your customers happy and maximize your profits.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Upgrade Your Pitches</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Improve various details of your football pitches, such as the ground, fences and walls.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3154800/extras/53c3f7273172369ce810944748da0a4a.poster.avif?t=1757247109\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3154800/extras/53c3f7273172369ce810944748da0a4a.webm?t=1757247109\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3154800/extras/53c3f7273172369ce810944748da0a4a.mp4?t=1757247109\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Repair Football Pitches</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Repair worn-out pitches, renew floors and freshen their paintwork. Both satisfy your customers and improve the quality of your business!&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3154800/extras/fbee5fd09a6210e191dfc6d0aa82e066.poster.avif?t=1757247109\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3154800/extras/fbee5fd09a6210e191dfc6d0aa82e066.webm?t=1757247109\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3154800/extras/fbee5fd09a6210e191dfc6d0aa82e066.mp4?t=1757247109\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Manage a Market</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Stock the shelves, set prices and hire a cashier! Run a perfect convenience store in your sports facility.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3154800/extras/462102cb0bb643077c3534edb3c1d343.poster.avif?t=1757247109\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3154800/extras/462102cb0bb643077c3534edb3c1d343.webm?t=1757247109\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3154800/extras/462102cb0bb643077c3534edb3c1d343.mp4?t=1757247109\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Expand Your Business</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Expand your football pitch complex and attract more customers by opening new areas!&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3154800/extras/b234d9c389202a688533f35b2c09957f.poster.avif?t=1757247109\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3154800/extras/b234d9c389202a688533f35b2c09957f.webm?t=1757247109\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://s